@startuml state03_roster_entry
title Roster Entry Confirmation (per member)

[*] --> Volunteered : volunteerForRequest\n(open request)
[*] --> AwaitingConfirmation : buildRoster\n(direct interest form)
[*] --> AwaitingConfirmation : assignProvider\n(Admin escalation)

Volunteered --> AwaitingConfirmation : confirmVolunteer\n(School accepts)
Volunteered --> [*] : removeVolunteer\n(self-withdraw >30 days,\nor Admin removes)

AwaitingConfirmation --> Confirmed : confirmAsUnit /\nconfirmAsAmbassador /\nconfirmVolunteer
AwaitingConfirmation --> [*] : removeVolunteer\n(Admin removes)

Confirmed --> [*]

note left of Volunteered
  Only exists for OPEN requests.
  A direct interest form skips
  straight to AwaitingConfirmation.
end note

note bottom of Confirmed
  Never reverts. The only way a
  Confirmed entry changes is an
  Admin deleting it outright.
end note

@enduml
